مجلس التاجر (Merchant Council)

This product is derived from "Roast Room" (https://github.com/nateherkai/roast-room),
Copyright (c) 2026 AI Automation Society, released under the MIT License (see LICENSE).
The original seat brains, agent definitions, caricature portraits, room app, and quote
checker come from Roast Room and are used under that license.

It has been substantially modified:
- Rebuilt as an Arabic, right-to-left product for Saudi and Gulf e-commerce merchants
  (Salla, Zid): Arabic seat instructions, round prompts, report, room UI, and PDF export.
- A new per-store customer seat («صوت العميل») built from the merchant's own reviews at
  onboarding, with an abstract, gender-neutral avatar and quote verification.
- A new onboarding interview, store profile template, and an Arabic example session for a
  fictional store.
- Honesty safeguards: a «محاكاة» tag on every seat and a disclaimer on the home page,
  every verdict, and every PDF.

The seven expert seats are simulations built from each person's published work. They are
not those people, do not speak for them, and have no affiliation with this product. Names
are used to identify the source of the ideas; any trademarks shown belong to their owners.
